              "id": "text-16",
              "kind": "text",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Nickel Alloy Monel® K500 | UNS# N05500 is an age hardenable nickel-copper alloy that demonstrates excellent corrosion resistance, good strength and hardness, mostly resistant to sour-gas environments, is nonmagnetic, and is superior to Alloy 400. Monel® K500 also has great mechanical properties in sub-zero temperatures and can be found in applications that include valve components for ships, offshore drilling, oil well collars, centrifugal pumps, impellers, and other similar"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Nickel Alloy Monel® K500 Specifications:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "AMS: AMS 4676"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "ASTM: ASTM B-865"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Please find Titanium Industries’ [Nickel Round Bar](https://qqa.titanium.com/product/mill-product-nickel-alloy-round-bar) here."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
